dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch mock_exam_return
when day >= 10
when study >= 88
when energy >= 35
line "模拟考结束时，雨正好停在校门口。"
line "秋起把试卷卷成筒，又展开，像不确定该怎么对待一只受伤的鸟。"
line "分数不坏，也不够漂亮。"
line "它站在中间，让人无法用胜利或失败偷懒。"
line "春伏没有问考得怎么样。"
line "她问，哪一道题让你觉得自己还在场。"
line "秋起想了很久，说，最后一道证明题。"
line "我没做完，但我知道下一步该写什么。"
line "这句话比高分更像归来。"
line "他们沿着操场外侧走，塑胶跑道积着浅水。"
line "秋起说，以前我只想把结果拿给别人看。"
line "现在我也想知道自己是怎么走到结果前面的。"
line "春伏把伞收好，伞尖滴水。"
line "她说，那就是学习。"
line "不是把你变成更会考试的人。"
line "是让你在看见难题时，不立刻把自己判出局。"
line "秋起把试卷放进包里，没有折得更小。"
line "回去的路上，他第一次主动说，今晚不写补丁，先改错题。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch teacher_meeting
when day >= 11
when study >= 92
when dependence <= 55
line "导师约在办公室谈话，门没关严。"
line "秋起站在门口，听见里面粉笔擦过黑板的声音。"
line "那声音让他想起许多次迟到、缺席、没有回复的邮件。"
line "他本能地想让春伏陪他进去。"
line "春伏却停在走廊，说，我在这里等。"
line "这句话没有冷淡，反而像一把稳稳放在墙边的伞。"
line "秋起独自敲门。"
line "导师看见他，只说，坐。"
line "谈话没有想象中严厉，也没有想象中宽容。"
line "导师逐条指出他缺的作业、能补的项目、不能再拖的手续。"
line "每一条都具体得无法用情绪反驳。"
line "秋起记到最后，手心全是汗。"
line "导师问，你现在还想毕业吗。"
line "秋起抬头，说，想。"
line "不是想逃离这里，是想把这里没有做完的事做完。"
line "走出办公室时，春伏没有问细节。"
line "她只递过一瓶水。"
line "秋起接住，像接住一种不替他回答的陪伴。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch archive_room_truth
when day >= 12
when study >= 96
when mod >= 70
line "档案室下午四点半关门，管理员已经开始收钥匙。"
line "秋起抱着申请材料跑到窗口前，气喘得像刚从旧生活里逃出来。"
line "缺的一份证明被夹在最底下。"
line "纸张边缘磨破，印章却清楚。"
line "管理员看了一眼，说，差点就过期。"
line "秋起笑不出来，只觉得后背一阵冷。"
line "原来人生不会因为剧情需要就替他延长截止时间。"
line "春伏在旁边签收回执，字迹比平时更慢。"
line "她说，你看，差点不是安全。"
line "秋起点头。"
line "他忽然明白，自己过去迷恋临界点。"
line "最后一分钟提交，最后一格体力撑住，最后一句道歉挽回。"
line "那样活着像在悬崖边证明平衡感。"
line "可他想要的生活，不该以坠落为前提。"
line "走出档案室时，天空灰得很均匀。"
line "他把回执夹进文件袋。"
line "春伏问，接下来呢。"
line "秋起说，提前一天做下一件事。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch leak_rumor
when day >= 10
when mod >= 95
when study >= 52
line "资源泄露的传闻最先出现在一个很小的论坛。"
line "标题写得暧昧，截图却足够刺眼。"
line "有人声称已经拿到未发布的 UI 素材。"
line "秋起的第一反应不是愤怒，而是冷。"
line "那种冷从指尖往上爬，像他亲手修好的门忽然被人摸到了锁孔。"
line "春伏把页面保存成证据，随后断开测试包下载链接。"
line "她的动作很快，却没有慌。"
line "两人开始核对 manifest 指纹、包版本、测试渠道。"
line "每一个时间戳都像询问：你有没有偷懒。"
line "秋起想起两天前临时发给朋友的构建包。"
line "那包没有正式 key，只是开发包。"
line "可开发包不等于可以被轻视的包。"
line "他把这句话写进事故记录，写得很重。"
line "春伏没有安慰。"
line "她说，先止血，再道歉，再修制度。"
line "他们撤掉旧包，轮换本地 key，更新测试分发名单。"
line "凌晨三点，传闻暂时没有扩散。"
line "秋起看着空荡荡的论坛页面，知道真正该修的是自己的侥幸。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch key_rotation_night
when day >= 11
when mod >= 96
when dependence <= 65
line "密钥轮换夜没有音乐，也没有戏剧性的黑客界面。"
line "只有表格、哈希、版本号和一杯已经凉透的茶。"
line "春伏负责核对渠道，秋起负责重建包。"
line "他们把开发 key 从旧配置里清出来。"
line "每删掉一处硬编码的路径，秋起都像从墙里拔出一根生锈的钉。"
line "他曾经觉得这些规范太严。"
line "现在才知道，规范不是为了让人显得专业。"
line "规范是在疲惫、赶工、侥幸同时出现时，替人守住底线。"
line "新包生成后，认证测试跑了七轮。"
line "第五轮失败，原因是一个资源分组仍沿用旧派生参数。"
line "秋起没有骂。"
line "他只是把失败编号写进表格，重新跑。"
line "春伏看了他一眼，说，你今天不像在赎罪。"
line "他说，我不想靠赎罪写代码。"
line "我想靠记住。"
line "天快亮时，新测试包终于通过。"
line "他们没有把旧包删进回收站。"
line "他们把它归档为事故样本，像保存一块烫伤后的皮肤。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch release_eve
when day >= 12
when mod >= 98
when bond >= 60
line "正式发布前夜，所有检查项都打上了勾。"
line "这反而让人不安。"
line "秋起坐在椅子上，像坐在一艘已经离岸的船里。"
line "春伏把最终包名念了一遍，确认没有错字。"
line "版本号、资源指纹、语言包、窗口图标、版权信息。"
line "这些词排列在一起，忽然比任何告白都正式。"
line "秋起说，如果明天还有 bug 呢。"
line "春伏说，会有。"
line "她答得太快，快到秋起笑出来。"
line "她接着说，所以我们才写回退、写复盘、写说明。"
line "不是为了让明天没有风。"
line "是为了风来时，房子知道自己哪里有梁。"
line "秋起把鼠标移到上传按钮旁，没有按。"
line "他先打开文档，补上最后一句发布说明。"
line "感谢测试者，也感谢那些尖锐但真实的反馈。"
line "写完后，他看向春伏。"
line "她点头。"
line "上传开始时，进度条慢慢向前，像一条终于承认自己会抵达的路。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch two_day_distance
when day >= 10
when bond >= 75
when dependence <= 65
line "春伏离开的第一晚，房间显得比平时大。"
line "不是空，是边界突然有了回声。"
line "秋起把她留下的便签贴在显示器边。"
line "吃饭，睡觉，自己决定一个问题。"
line "前两项像生活，第三项像考试。"
line "他打开 issue 列表，手指悬在最想发给她的那个问题上。"
line "三分钟后，他把聊天窗口关掉。"
line "不是赌气，也不是逞强。"
line "他只是把问题拆成三句，写进自己的笔记。"
line "现象是什么。"
line "我已经验证了什么。"
line "下一步最小行动是什么。"
line "答案慢慢浮上来，像水底的石阶。"
line "晚上十点，他给春伏发消息。"
line "我吃饭了，睡前会关机，今天自己决定了资源回退策略。"
line "隔了很久，她回了一个句号和一句：很好。"
line "秋起看着那两个字，竟然比收到长篇安慰还踏实。"
line "原来被相信，有时就是不被立刻拯救。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch unsent_message
when day >= 11
when bond >= 78
when dependence >= 50
line "第二天夜里，秋起写了一条很长的消息。"
line "开头是想你，中间是解释，结尾几乎变成求救。"
line "他把光标停在发送键前。"
line "屏幕上的字一行行站着，像一支等待命令的队伍。"
line "他忽然看见，每一句想念后面都藏着要求。"
line "要求她回来，要求她证明，要求她替他把夜晚变短。"
line "这并不等于想念是假的。"
line "只是想念不能总穿着求援的衣服。"
line "秋起把消息复制到笔记里，标题写作未发送。"
line "然后删掉聊天框。"
line "他给自己倒水，坐回桌前。"
line "窗口里还有一处字体 fallback 没修。"
line "他修完，跑测试，记录结果。"
line "凌晨一点，他只发了一句：今天也完成了一个小问题。"
line "春伏早上才回：我看见了。"
line "这四个字没有拥抱，却让秋起把手机扣到胸口。"
line "他知道自己还是会依赖。"
line "但依赖终于开始学习怎样不变成索取。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch return_station
when day >= 12
when bond >= 85
when dependence <= 70
line "春伏回来时，站台广播正好报到末班车。"
line "秋起没有提前跑到车门边。"
line "他站在黄线外，手里拿着一杯温热的茶。"
line "春伏下车，看见他，第一句话是，你睡觉了吗。"
line "他说，睡了。"
line "第二句是，你吃饭了吗。"
line "他说，吃了。"
line "她接过茶，终于笑出来。"
line "这笑不是奖赏，更像确认一盏灯没有被风吹灭。"
line "他们并肩往出口走。"
line "秋起讲这两天遇到的问题，讲自己怎样拆解，怎样犯错，怎样修正。"
line "春伏听得很认真，却没有立刻点评。"
line "到扶梯口，她说，你好像变远了一点。"
line "秋起心里一紧。"
line "她接着说，但也更清楚了。"
line "他握着空茶杯，忽然觉得这比靠近更难得。"
line "出口的风很凉。"
line "他们没有牵手，却走得同样慢。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch empty_day
when day >= 10
when energy <= 55
when bond >= 60
line "那天没有发生值得写进日志的事。"
line "秋起早起，买早饭，排队，回家。"
line "洗衣机转了四十二分钟，阳台上的水一滴滴落进桶里。"
line "他本来想把这一天归类为无效。"
line "可傍晚整理床铺时，他忽然停住。"
line "床单晒过太阳，有很轻的洗衣粉味。"
line "桌面没有新的崩溃报告。"
line "身体也没有发出抗议。"
line "原来无事发生，有时正是生活在修复。"
line "春伏发来一张路边树影的照片。"
line "没有说明，没有表情。"
line "秋起回了一张自己的晚饭。"
line "两张照片隔着屏幕并排，像两块没有剧情功能的拼图。"
line "可它们把一天拼完整了。"
line "晚上他没有打开项目。"
line "他读了二十页小说，读得很慢。"
line "故事里的人也在学习如何活得不那么用力。"
line "秋起把书签夹好，觉得今天并非空白。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch morning_after_release
when day >= 13
when mod >= 98
when energy <= 70
line "发布后的早晨没有想象中灿烂。"
line "秋起醒来时，脖子酸，窗帘漏进一条灰白的光。"
line "手机上有新反馈，也有祝贺，还有两个看不懂的错误截图。"
line "他差点立刻坐起来。"
line "春伏的消息先跳出来：先喝水。"
line "他盯着那三个字，笑了一下。"
line "于是先喝水。"
line "水很普通，甚至有一点凉。"
line "可这普通把他从发布后的虚浮里拽回地面。"
line "他吃完早饭，才打开反馈表。"
line "把祝贺归档，把问题编号，把情绪放到一边。"
line "太阳慢慢爬上窗台。"
line "秋起忽然明白，发布不是终点的烟火。"
line "发布是把作品交给现实，然后仍然愿意照顾它。"
line "春伏到中午才过来，手里提着药和甜面包。"
line "她说，看吧，世界没有因为上线就温柔。"
line "秋起接过面包，说，也没有因为不温柔就不可爱。"
line "他们在桌边坐下，开始处理第一张错误截图。"

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch mock_exam_return
when day >= 10
when study >= 88
when energy >= 35
line "The mock exam ends as the rain stops."
line "The score is neither triumph nor ruin."
line "Harufushi asks which problem made him feel present."
line "Akioki names the proof he could not finish."
line "Knowing the next line is a kind of return."
line "That night he chooses corrections before patches."

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch teacher_meeting
when day >= 11
when study >= 92
when dependence <= 55
line "The advisor's door is half open."
line "Harufushi waits in the hall instead of entering with him."
line "The meeting is neither cruel nor forgiving."
line "It is specific: missing work, possible repairs, hard deadlines."
line "Akioki says he still wants to graduate."
line "Not to escape, but to finish what he left unfinished."

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch archive_room_truth
when day >= 12
when study >= 96
when mod >= 70
line "The archive room nearly closes before he arrives."
line "The missing certificate is frayed but valid."
line "Almost late is not safe, Harufushi says."
line "Akioki recognizes his old worship of last chances."
line "He files the receipt carefully."
line "The next task will be done one day early."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch leak_rumor
when day >= 10
when mod >= 95
when study >= 52
line "The leak rumor starts on a small forum."
line "The screenshot is vague enough to wound and clear enough to matter."
line "They cut the test link, check fingerprints, and trace channels."
line "Akioki remembers the development build he sent too casually."
line "Stop bleeding, apologize, then fix the system, Harufushi says."
line "By dawn, the rumor is smaller, but his carelessness is not."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch key_rotation_night
when day >= 11
when mod >= 96
when dependence <= 65
line "Key rotation night has no music and no cinematic hacker screen."
line "Only hashes, versions, package groups, and cold tea."
line "Every removed hardcoded path feels like a rusty nail pulled from a wall."
line "Rules are not decoration."
line "They guard the line when fatigue and luck start bargaining."
line "The old package is archived as an accident sample."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch release_eve
when day >= 12
when mod >= 98
when bond >= 60
line "On release eve, every checklist item is marked."
line "That makes Akioki more nervous, not less."
line "Harufushi reminds him bugs will still come."
line "That is why rollback, postmortem, and notes exist."
line "He adds one last thanks to sharp but honest feedback."
line "The upload bar moves like a road admitting it can arrive."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch two_day_distance
when day >= 10
when bond >= 75
when dependence <= 65
line "The first night without Harufushi makes the room larger."
line "Her note says: eat, sleep, decide one thing alone."
line "Akioki closes the chat window and writes the question in his notebook."
line "What is the symptom. What have I verified. What is the smallest next action."
line "He sends her the result, not the panic."
line "Being trusted sometimes means not being rescued immediately."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch unsent_message
when day >= 11
when bond >= 78
when dependence >= 50
line "Akioki writes a long message and does not send it."
line "Every sentence of missing her is carrying a demand."
line "Missing her is not false."
line "It simply cannot always dress as rescue."
line "He fixes the font fallback instead."
line "Dependence begins learning how not to become extraction."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch return_station
when day >= 12
when bond >= 85
when dependence <= 70
line "Harufushi returns on the last train."
line "Akioki waits behind the yellow line with warm tea."
line "He slept, ate, and made decisions."
line "She says he seems farther away, then clearer."
line "The words frighten him before they steady him."
line "They leave the station slowly, not holding hands."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch empty_day
when day >= 10
when energy <= 55
when bond >= 60
line "Nothing worth logging happens."
line "Breakfast, laundry, dinner, a photo of tree shadows."
line "Akioki almost calls the day invalid."
line "Then he notices the clean sheets and his unprotesting body."
line "Sometimes nothing happens because life is repairing."
line "He reads a novel and lets the day stay quiet."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch morning_after_release
when day >= 13
when mod >= 98
when energy <= 70
line "The morning after release is gray, not glorious."
line "Feedback, praise, and two strange bug screenshots wait on the phone."
line "Harufushi's message arrives first: drink water."
line "So he drinks water."
line "Release is not fireworks at the end."
line "It is giving the work to reality and still caring for it."

dialogue ja-JP study アキオキ
branch mock_exam_return
when day >= 10
when study >= 88
when energy >= 35
line "模試が終わると同時に雨が止む。"
line "点数は勝利でも破滅でもない。"
line "ハルフシは、どの問題で自分がそこにいると思えたかを聞く。"
line "アキオキは解き切れなかった証明を挙げる。"
line "次の一行が見えることは、帰還の一種だ。"
line "その夜、彼はパッチより先に誤答を直す。"

dialogue ja-JP study アキオキ
branch teacher_meeting
when day >= 11
when study >= 92
when dependence <= 55
line "指導教員の扉は半分開いている。"
line "ハルフシは一緒に入らず廊下で待つ。"
line "面談は厳しすぎず、甘くもない。"
line "足りない課題、補える項目、もう延ばせない手続き。"
line "アキオキは、まだ卒業したいと言う。"
line "逃げるためではなく、残したものを終えるために。"

dialogue ja-JP study アキオキ
branch archive_room_truth
when day >= 12
when study >= 96
when mod >= 70
line "資料室は閉まる寸前だった。"
line "足りなかった証明書は擦り切れているが有効だ。"
line "ぎりぎりは安全じゃない、とハルフシは言う。"
line "アキオキは最後の機会を崇拝していた自分に気づく。"
line "彼は受領書を丁寧にしまう。"
line "次の作業は一日前に終わらせる。"

dialogue ja-JP modding ハルフシ
branch leak_rumor
when day >= 10
when mod >= 95
when study >= 52
line "流出の噂は小さな掲示板から始まる。"
line "曖昧なスクショは、傷つけるには十分だった。"
line "二人はテストリンクを切り、指紋と配布経路を追う。"
line "アキオキは軽く送った開発ビルドを思い出す。"
line "止血、謝罪、それから制度を直す、とハルフシは言う。"
line "夜明け、噂は小さくなったが、油断は小さくならない。"

dialogue ja-JP modding ハルフシ
branch key_rotation_night
when day >= 11
when mod >= 96
when dependence <= 65
line "鍵の更新夜に音楽も映画的な画面もない。"
line "あるのはハッシュ、版、資源グループ、冷めた茶だけ。"
line "ハードコードされた道を消すたび、錆びた釘を抜くようだ。"
line "規則は飾りではない。"
line "疲れと幸運が取引を始める時、線を守るものだ。"
line "旧パッケージは事故サンプルとして保存される。"

dialogue ja-JP modding ハルフシ
branch release_eve
when day >= 12
when mod >= 98
when bond >= 60
line "正式公開前夜、チェックはすべて埋まっている。"
line "そのせいで、かえって落ち着かない。"
line "ハルフシは、明日もバグは来ると言う。"
line "だからロールバック、復盤、説明を書く。"
line "彼は鋭く正直なフィードバックへの感謝を足す。"
line "アップロードバーは、到着を認める道のように進む。"

dialogue ja-JP harufushi ハルフシ
branch two_day_distance
when day >= 10
when bond >= 75
when dependence <= 65
line "ハルフシがいない最初の夜、部屋は広くなる。"
line "メモには、食べる、眠る、一問だけ自分で決める。"
line "アキオキはチャットを閉じ、問いをノートへ書く。"
line "現象は何か。何を検証したか。最小の次手は何か。"
line "彼は恐怖ではなく結果を送る。"
line "信頼されるとは、すぐ救われないことでもある。"

dialogue ja-JP harufushi ハルフシ
branch unsent_message
when day >= 11
when bond >= 78
when dependence >= 50
line "アキオキは長いメッセージを書き、送らない。"
line "寂しいという文の後ろに、要求が隠れている。"
line "寂しさが嘘なわけではない。"
line "ただ、いつも救援の服を着てはいけない。"
line "彼は代わりにフォントfallbackを直す。"
line "依存は、奪取にならない方法を学び始める。"

dialogue ja-JP harufushi ハルフシ
branch return_station
when day >= 12
when bond >= 85
when dependence <= 70
line "ハルフシは終電で戻る。"
line "アキオキは黄色い線の外で温かい茶を持って待つ。"
line "彼は眠り、食べ、自分で決めた。"
line "少し遠くなった、でもはっきりした、と彼女は言う。"
line "その言葉は怖く、それから支えになる。"
line "二人は手をつながず、ゆっくり駅を出る。"

dialogue ja-JP rest アキオキ
branch empty_day
when day >= 10
when energy <= 55
when bond >= 60
line "記録に残ることは何も起きない。"
line "朝食、洗濯、夕飯、木陰の写真。"
line "アキオキはその日を無効と呼びかける。"
line "そして乾いたシーツと、抗議しない身体に気づく。"
line "何も起きないのは、生活が修復しているからかもしれない。"
line "彼は小説を読み、静かな日を静かなままにする。"

dialogue ja-JP rest アキオキ
branch morning_after_release
when day >= 13
when mod >= 98
when energy <= 70
line "公開翌朝は、輝かしくなく灰色だ。"
line "フィードバック、祝福、読めないエラー画像が携帯にある。"
line "最初にハルフシのメッセージが来る。水を飲んで。"
line "だから彼は水を飲む。"
line "公開は終点の花火ではない。"
line "作品を現実へ渡し、それでも世話を続けることだ。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch library_closure
when day >= 13
when study >= 98
when energy <= 60
line "图书馆闭馆音乐响起时，秋起刚好写完最后一道错题。"
line "那旋律很老，像学校每天固定的一次叹息。"
line "管理员从书架尽头走过来，提醒他们收拾。"
line "春伏把橡皮屑扫进掌心，没有催他。"
line "秋起盯着本子上最后一行推导。"
line "那行字不漂亮，却完整。"
line "他忽然想起很久以前，自己总在闭馆前装作忙碌。"
line "把书摊开，把眉头皱紧，好像这样就能证明一天没有荒废。"
line "今天他没有表演。"
line "他真的完成了一件小事。"
line "走出大门时，夜风吹过台阶，带着潮湿的树叶味。"
line "春伏问，明天还来吗。"
line "秋起说，来，但不坐到闭馆。"
line "这句话让两个人都笑了。"
line "曾经他把离开座位当成失败。"
line "现在他知道，能按时离开也是一种完成。"
line "校门外的路灯一盏盏亮着。"
line "他把笔记本抱在胸前，像抱着一份终于不用夸张的努力。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch wrong_answer_letter
when day >= 14
when study >= 100
when bond >= 70
line "秋起给过去的自己写了一封信。"
line "开头写了三遍，都像廉价的鼓励。"
line "第四遍，他只写：你当时确实做错了。"
line "这句话很冷，却让后面的句子终于能站稳。"
line "你逃课，撒谎，拖延，把求救包装成脾气。"
line "你让关心你的人学会小心说话。"
line "但你也不是一张废纸。"
line "你只是把太多空白误认成判决。"
line "春伏坐在旁边读到这里，停了一下。"
line "她问，可以继续看吗。"
line "秋起点头。"
line "信的后半段没有宏大的决心。"
line "只有明天几点起床，哪门课先复习，哪封邮件要回复。"
line "春伏说，这比誓言难写。"
line "秋起说，因为誓言不用真的排进日程。"
line "他们把信夹进错题本。"
line "不是为了纪念痛苦。"
line "是为了提醒自己，温柔也需要具体。"

dialogue zh-CN study 秋起
branch exam_gate
when day >= 15
when study >= 100
when dependence <= 60
line "正式考试那天，校门口挤满了人。"
line "每个人都拿着透明笔袋，像拿着一小袋各自的人生证据。"
line "春伏送到警戒线外就停下。"
line "秋起回头看她。"
line "她没有比口型说加油。"
line "她只是举起手，掌心朝他，像把最后一段路交还给他。"
line "秋起突然不想再要求更多。"
line "他已经带着足够多的东西。"
line "错题、睡眠、道歉、发布事故、那张没发送的长消息。"
line "还有春伏没有替他走完的每一步。"
line "进考场前，他把手机关机。"
line "屏幕黑下去时，他没有慌。"
line "监考老师核对证件，笔尖在名单上轻轻划过。"
line "秋起坐下，打开试卷。"
line "第一题不难。"
line "第二题也不温柔。"
line "他深吸一口气。"
line "然后写下第一行，字迹平稳得几乎陌生。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch false_positive
when day >= 13
when mod >= 98
when study >= 70
line "凌晨的安全告警把两个人从浅睡里拽起来。"
line "红色标签写着资源包认证异常。"
line "秋起的第一反应是心脏猛地空了一拍。"
line "春伏披上外套，声音还带着睡意，却很稳。"
line "先确认，不要想象。"
line "他们打开日志，检查指纹，复跑下载。"
line "十七分钟后，异常被定位到镜像缓存延迟。"
line "不是泄露，不是篡改，只是一场误报。"
line "秋起坐回椅子，手指还在发麻。"
line "他本来该松一口气，却忽然有些想笑。"
line "原来系统认真到连误会都很具体。"
line "春伏把事件记录归档，分类写 false positive。"
line "她说，误报也要复盘。"
line "不是因为它有罪。"
line "是因为下一次真出事时，你不能先被自己的恐惧击穿。"
line "秋起点头，把告警阈值调整说明补进文档。"
line "天还没亮。"
line "他们在同一张桌子前喝完了重新热过的茶。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch public_reply
when day >= 14
when mod >= 99
when bond >= 65
line "发布帖下面的第七页评论开始变得尖锐。"
line "有人质疑资源保护只是噱头，有人说 UI 改动多此一举。"
line "秋起读到第三遍，终于把浏览器关了。"
line "春伏没有劝他别看。"
line "她说，看可以，但要知道自己为什么看。"
line "他们把需要回复的问题摘出来。"
line "能解释的解释，能承认的承认，不能公开的安全细节不拿来炫耀。"
line "秋起写到一半，删掉一句带刺的话。"
line "那句话很爽，但没有用。"
line "他重新写：感谢指出，下一版会调整按钮高度，并补充语言 fallback 说明。"
line "春伏看完，说，像个人。"
line "秋起说，你这是夸我吗。"
line "她说，是最低规格的夸奖。"
line "回复发出去后，评论没有立刻变好。"
line "现实很少按下发送就结算。"
line "可秋起至少没有把自己的不安泼回玩家身上。"
line "这也是一种发布后的维护。"
line "维护作品，也维护说话的方式。"

dialogue zh-CN modding 春伏
branch coauthored_patch
when day >= 15
when mod >= 100
when bond >= 80
line "最后一个热修补丁的提交信息写到一半，秋起停住。"
line "作者栏里只有他的名字。"
line "春伏正在旁边整理测试截图，没注意到他。"
line "他看着那行名字，忽然觉得它太窄。"
line "这不是礼貌问题。"
line "有些工作不是写代码的人一个人完成的。"
line "有人拦下错误的发送，有人记住复盘，有人在他想逃的时候关上电脑。"
line "秋起问，能不能共同署名。"
line "春伏愣了一下，说，我没有写那段函数。"
line "他说，你写了让我能写那段函数的条件。"
line "这句话让房间安静了很久。"
line "春伏低头检查截图，耳尖慢慢红了。"
line "她说，那提交信息要写清楚。"
line "于是他们把修复内容、测试范围、共同署名一条条写完。"
line "按下提交时，秋起没有觉得自己被分走了什么。"
line "相反，他第一次觉得成果变得更完整。"
line "提交记录里多了一个名字。"
line "那名字不是依附，是共同承担。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch low_dependence_evening
when day >= 13
when bond >= 82
when dependence <= 40
line "傍晚，春伏发现秋起已经把晚饭预约好了。"
line "不是为了证明自己能照顾人。"
line "只是因为他看见她下午一直没有离开椅子。"
line "这件小事让她沉默了几秒。"
line "秋起有些紧张，问是不是不合胃口。"
line "春伏摇头。"
line "她说，我只是不太习惯你不把照顾做成求表扬的样子。"
line "这句话说得很轻，却把旧日的影子照了出来。"
line "秋起没有立刻解释。"
line "他把筷子递过去，说，那你慢慢习惯。"
line "饭盒打开时，热气漫上来。"
line "两个人并排坐着，电视里播着没人认真看的新闻。"
line "春伏吃到一半，说，今天我有点累。"
line "秋起说，那吃完就回去休息。"
line "她问，你不需要我留下吗。"
line "他看着汤面上的葱花，说，需要和想要不是一回事。"
line "我想你留下，但你该休息。"
line "春伏低头吃饭，许久才说，这句很好。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch high_dependence_crack
when day >= 13
when bond >= 82
when dependence >= 70
line "同样的傍晚，秋起在春伏准备离开时叫住了她。"
line "他说再陪我十分钟。"
line "春伏看了看时间，说我真的该走了。"
line "他说，就十分钟。"
line "这四个字太熟悉，熟悉到两个人都沉默下来。"
line "春伏把包带从肩上放下，又重新背好。"
line "她说，你看，你不是想让我留下。"
line "你是想让我证明你还可以继续不长大。"
line "秋起脸色白了。"
line "这句话没有提高音量，却像把灯全部打开。"
line "他想说不是。"
line "可是桌上的外卖盒、未关的错误列表、她眼底的疲惫都在替他作证。"
line "春伏走到门口，停了一下。"
line "她说，我明天会来，但不是为了收拾今天这句话。"
line "门关上后，房间没有立刻变空。"
line "它先变得很吵。"
line "秋起坐在椅子上，听见自己终于开始为一个选择付出代价。"
line "这不是坏结局，只是不能再装作没有裂缝。"

dialogue zh-CN harufushi 春伏
branch shared_nameplate
when day >= 15
when bond >= 92
when dependence <= 65
line "发布页的贡献名单需要最后确认。"
line "秋起把春伏的名字放在自己旁边，中间没有斜杠。"
line "春伏看见后，说，这样会不会让人误会。"
line "秋起问，误会什么。"
line "她说，误会我们很稳定。"
line "这句话让两个人都笑了，又很快安静下来。"
line "稳定不是他们天然拥有的东西。"
line "它是一次次没有逃跑、没有索取、没有把沉默当惩罚换来的。"
line "秋起把页面预览放大。"
line "两个名字并排，字体很普通。"
line "没有心形，没有装饰，没有把关系变成广告。"
line "春伏看了很久，说，普通得有点好。"
line "秋起说，我也是这么想的。"
line "保存前，他又检查了一遍版权、公司、语言说明。"
line "现实的细节围在名字周围，像给感情装上地基。"
line "春伏靠在椅背上，轻轻呼出一口气。"
line "她说，那就这样。"
line "于是两个名字被留在发布页上，安静、并列、可追责。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch quiet_failure
when day >= 13
when energy <= 35
when mod >= 90
line "那天秋起什么都没修好。"
line "不是戏剧性的失败，没有崩溃，没有争吵。"
line "只是每个问题都多绕一步，每次尝试都回到原地。"
line "下午四点，他终于合上电脑。"
line "这动作没有胜利感。"
line "更像承认今天的路走到这里就没了。"
line "春伏发来消息，问结果如何。"
line "秋起打了很久，最后只回：失败了，但我停下了。"
line "隔了几分钟，春伏回：这两件事都要记。"
line "他看着屏幕，胸口那团硬东西慢慢松开。"
line "过去他只会记录成功，仿佛失败没有文档就不存在。"
line "可没有文档的失败最会复发。"
line "他打开笔记，写下假设、尝试、结果、停止原因。"
line "最后一栏写：明天再看。"
line "这四个字没有光芒。"
line "但它们把夜晚从失败手里赎回一点。"
line "秋起关灯。"
line "没有修好的一天，也没有把他修坏。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch shared_silence
when day >= 14
when bond >= 88
when energy >= 65
line "两个人在同一间屋子里各做各的事。"
line "春伏看书，秋起整理旧 issue。"
line "他们一个小时没有说话。"
line "这沉默不是冷战，也不是尴尬。"
line "它像一张结实的桌子，允许不同的东西同时摆在上面。"
line "秋起偶尔抬头，看见春伏把书页翻过去。"
line "他没有立刻把这个瞬间变成话题。"
line "以前他害怕沉默。"
line "沉默像倒计时，像有人即将离开。"
line "现在沉默只是沉默。"
line "窗外有孩子在楼下跑过，笑声很快远去。"
line "春伏忽然说，这一页写得真好。"
line "秋起问哪一句。"
line "她读给他听。"
line "句子不长，却让房间变得更深。"
line "秋起没有评价，只说，再读一遍。"
line "于是她又读了一遍。"
line "他们把这一晚留给文字，而不是把文字变成证明。"

dialogue zh-CN rest 秋起
branch final_daybreak
when day >= 16
when mod >= 100
when study >= 100
when bond >= 90
line "最后的清晨来得很慢。"
line "窗外天色从蓝灰变成浅白，城市像刚刚重新加载。"
line "秋起坐在桌前，没有打开任何工程。"
line "春伏把两杯水放下，一杯推给他，一杯留给自己。"
line "他们面前摊着三样东西：准考证、发布清单、一本写满旧错误的笔记。"
line "哪一样都不是结局。"
line "它们只是证明，人可以带着未完成继续出门。"
line "秋起说，我以前以为补丁能修好我。"
line "春伏说，补丁只能修软件。"
line "他说，那你呢。"
line "她看着窗外，没有立刻回答。"
line "过了一会儿，她说，我也不能修好你。"
line "但我可以和你一起确认，哪里不该再坏下去。"
line "这答案没有甜得发腻。"
line "正因为如此，秋起觉得它可以相信。"
line "楼下第一班公交驶过，带起很轻的风。"
line "他们收拾东西，关灯，出门。"
line "门锁扣上的声音清楚、平稳，像新一天的第一行。"

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch library_closure
when day >= 13
when study >= 98
when energy <= 60
line "The library closing music starts as Akioki finishes the last correction."
line "Today he is not performing effort."
line "He has completed one small thing."
line "Harufushi asks if they will come again tomorrow."
line "He says yes, but not until closing."
line "Leaving on time becomes a kind of completion."

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch wrong_answer_letter
when day >= 14
when study >= 100
when bond >= 70
line "Akioki writes a letter to his past self."
line "The fourth draft begins: you really were wrong."
line "Cold truth lets the later kindness stand."
line "The letter contains schedules, emails, and tomorrow's first task."
line "Harufushi says that is harder than a vow."
line "Vows do not have to fit into a calendar."

dialogue en-US study Akioki
branch exam_gate
when day >= 15
when study >= 100
when dependence <= 60
line "At the exam gate, Harufushi stops outside the line."
line "She does not mouth encouragement."
line "She only raises her hand and gives him the last steps back."
line "Akioki turns off his phone without panic."
line "The first question is not hard, and the second is not kind."
line "He writes the first line steadily."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch false_positive
when day >= 13
when mod >= 98
when study >= 70
line "A red security alert wakes them before dawn."
line "Seventeen minutes later, it is only a mirror cache delay."
line "The fear remains useful."
line "False positives deserve postmortems too."
line "Next time the danger may be real."
line "Akioki adjusts the threshold and documents why."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch public_reply
when day >= 14
when mod >= 99
when bond >= 65
line "The seventh page of comments grows sharp."
line "Akioki deletes the sentence that would have felt good and helped no one."
line "He explains what can be explained and admits what must be admitted."
line "The reply does not fix the thread immediately."
line "Reality rarely settles on send."
line "But he does not pour fear back onto players."

dialogue en-US modding Harufushi
branch coauthored_patch
when day >= 15
when mod >= 100
when bond >= 80
line "The final hotfix commit pauses at the author field."
line "Akioki asks whether they can coauthor it."
line "Harufushi says she did not write the function."
line "You wrote the conditions that let me write it, he says."
line "The commit records both names."
line "Not attachment, but shared responsibility."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch low_dependence_evening
when day >= 13
when bond >= 82
when dependence <= 40
line "Akioki orders dinner because Harufushi has not left the chair all afternoon."
line "He does not turn care into a request for praise."
line "She notices."
line "I want you to stay, he says, but you should rest."
line "Need and want are not the same."
line "Harufushi lowers her eyes and says the sentence is good."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch high_dependence_crack
when day >= 13
when bond >= 82
when dependence >= 70
line "Akioki asks for ten more minutes as Harufushi leaves."
line "The words are too familiar."
line "She says he is asking her to prove he can keep refusing to grow."
line "No one raises their voice."
line "The room becomes bright with consequence."
line "This is not a bad ending, but it cannot pretend there is no crack."

dialogue en-US harufushi Harufushi
branch shared_nameplate
when day >= 15
when bond >= 92
when dependence <= 65
line "The release page needs the final contributor names."
line "Akioki places Harufushi's name beside his without decoration."
line "Stable is not something they naturally were."
line "It was made by not running, not taking, not weaponizing silence."
line "The plain names look almost good."
line "They save the page, side by side and accountable."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch quiet_failure
when day >= 13
when energy <= 35
when mod >= 90
line "Akioki fixes nothing that day."
line "No crash, no argument, only attempts returning to the same place."
line "He writes: failed, but stopped."
line "Harufushi replies that both parts matter."
line "He documents the failure instead of erasing it."
line "An unfixed day does not unmake him."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch shared_silence
when day >= 14
when bond >= 88
when energy >= 65
line "They spend an hour in the same room without talking."
line "Harufushi reads while Akioki sorts old issues."
line "Silence is no longer a countdown."
line "It is a sturdy table for different things."
line "She reads a sentence aloud."
line "He asks her to read it again."

dialogue en-US rest Akioki
branch final_daybreak
when day >= 16
when mod >= 100
when study >= 100
when bond >= 90
line "The final daybreak arrives slowly."
line "Admission slip, release checklist, and old wrong answers lie on the desk."
line "None of them is an ending."
line "Patches can only repair software, Harufushi says."
line "But they can confirm what should not break again."
line "The door locks behind them like the first line of a new day."

